{
  "name": "Grenade, Smoke",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "value": "<p>As an action, you can throw a grenade at a point up to 60 feet away, or propel it with a Grenade Launcher to a point up to 1,000 feet away. It explodes at that point, creating its effect in a 20-foot-radius Sphere.</p><p>Smoke fills the Sphere, making it Heavily Obscured for 1 minute. A strong wind, such as the one created by a Gust of Wind spell, disperses the smoke.</p><p><strong>Availability.</strong> If explosives can be bought, treat them as Rare magic items.</p>"
    },
